{"suttaId":"tha-ap450","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[975,1007],"vripara":"50"},"segments":{"tha-ap450:0.3":"Pādapīṭhiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap450:1.1":"“Sumedho nāma sambuddho, aggo kāruṇiko muni;","tha-ap450:1.3":"Tārayitvā bahū satte, nibbuto so mahāyaso.","tha-ap450:2.1":"“Sīhāsanassa sāmantā, sumedhassa mahesino;","tha-ap450:2.3":"Pasannacitto sumano, pādapīṭhamakārayiṃ.","tha-ap450:3.1":"“Katvāna kusalaṃ kammaṃ, sukhapākaṃ sukhudrayaṃ;","tha-ap450:3.3":"Puññakammena saṃyutto, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","tha-ap450:4.1":"“Tattha me vasamānassa, puññakammasamaṅgino;","tha-ap450:4.3":"Padāni uddharantassa, soṇṇapīṭhā bhavanti me.","tha-ap450:5.1":"“Lābhā tesaṃ suladdhaṃ vo, ye labhanti upassutiṃ;","tha-ap450:5.3":"Nibbute kāraṃ katvāna, labhanti vipulaṃ sukhaṃ.","tha-ap450:6.1":"“Mayāpi sukataṃ kammaṃ, vāṇijjaṃ suppayojitaṃ;","tha-ap450:6.3":"Pādapīṭhaṃ karitvāna, soṇṇapīṭhaṃ labhāmahaṃ.","tha-ap450:7.1":"“Yaṃ yaṃ disaṃ pakkamāmi, kenaci kiccayenahaṃ [paccayenahaṃ (sī. pī.)];","tha-ap450:7.3":"Soṇṇapīṭhe akkamāmi [soṇṇapīṭhena kamāmi (ka.)], puññakammassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap450:8.1":"“Tiṃsakappasahassamhi, yaṃ kammamakariṃ tadā;","tha-ap450:8.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, pādapīṭhassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap450:9.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap450:10.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap450:11.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap450:12.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā pādapīṭhiyo thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap450:13.1":"Pādapīṭhiyattherassāpadānaṃ aṭṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
